Zero point energy                ...      0.08021314 Eh      50.33 kcal/mol
Thermal vibrational correction   ...      0.00145931 Eh       0.92 kcal/mol
Thermal rotational correction    ...      0.00141627 Eh       0.89 kcal/mol
